{"unit_id":"123dbl__dsh-side-session#card-zh","repo":"123dbl/dsh-side-session","commit":"39443eb1ea15fb080121a3a6474426980f346a6c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-side-session 是一个面向 DSH 网页客户端的旁会话插件，可从当前会话创建独立且可继续对话的子代理。它在宿主注册 /side-chat 命令，并在浏览器收到命令成功事件后刷新子会话目录、识别新建的可继续子会话并打开其正式聊天视图。用户可以让主会话与旁会话并行处理不同问题，再在新会话中继续交流。插件需要宿主提供命令和子代理服务，以及支持相关会话目录能力的网页客户端；代码没有声明额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:53-77","src/client/index.ts:88-95"]}
{"unit_id":"123dbl__dsh-side-session#card-en","repo":"123dbl/dsh-side-session","commit":"39443eb1ea15fb080121a3a6474426980f346a6c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-side-session adds side chats to DSH web. The /side-chat command starts a continuable child with a ready prompt and timestamp. On success, the browser finds and opens the new chat, which can run alongside the parent. It requires host command and subagent services.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:53-77","src/client/index.ts:88-95"]}
